{"sha": "141d1cf5ba0f914e7a808f374a1cfede2a0152fd22ca4f7c38eafd543094d655", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g8:cosine} 章 --- 直角三角形与余弦}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:1}", "直角所对的中线等于斜边的一半，即 $6.5$ 厘米", "（\\cref{thm:g8:cosine:circle}）。外接圆的圆心位于斜边中点，", "半径为 $6.5$ 厘米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:2}", "点 $A$ 处的角为直角（$[BC]$ 为直径，", "由\\cref{thm:g8:cosine:circle}的第 2 点）。测量值满足", "$AB^2 + AC^2 \\approx 64 = BC^2$，在测量精度范围内。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:3}", "斜边为 $[EF]$（直角 $D$ 所对的边）。", "与 $\\widehat E$ 相邻的边为 $[ED]$，对边为 $[DF]$。于是", "$\\cos\\widehat E = \\dfrac{ED}{EF}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:4}", "\\emph{1.} 邻边 $= 10 \\cos 35^\\circ \\approx 8.2$。", "", "\\emph{2.} 斜边 $= \\dfrac{6}{\\cos 50^\\circ} \\approx", "\\dfrac{6}{0.643} \\approx 9.3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:5}", "$\\cos\\theta = \\frac{8}{10} = 0.8$，于是", "$\\theta = \\cos^{-1}(0.8) \\approx 37^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:6}", "$\\cos\\theta$ 等于直角边除以斜边，而斜边", "是直角三角形中\\emph{最长}的边，因此该商", "总小于 $1$。若取值为 $1.2$，则直角边长于", "斜边 --- 这是不可能的。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:7}", "水平跨度 $= 25 \\cos 12^\\circ \\approx 25 \\times 0.978 \\approx", "24.5$ 米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:8}", "余弦随角增大而减小", "（见\\cref{prop:g8:cosine:bounds}）：", "\\[", "\\cos 70^\\circ < \\cos 45^\\circ < \\cos 20^\\circ .", "\\]", "（计算器：$0.342 < 0.707 < 0.940$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:9}", "地面距离与 $\\theta$ 相邻：", "$\\cos 68^\\circ = \\frac{1.2}{L}$，于是", "$L = \\frac{1.2}{0.375} = 3.2$ 米。高度（由毕达哥拉斯定理）：", "$\\sqrt{3.2^2 - 1.2^2} = \\sqrt{10.24 - 1.44} = \\sqrt{8.8} \\approx 3.0$", "米。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:10}", "\\emph{1.} 点 $A$ 在以 $[BC]$ 为直径的圆上，$A$ 处为直角，", "由\\cref{thm:g8:cosine:circle}可知。", "", "\\emph{2.} $BC = 9$ 厘米（半径的两倍）。由毕达哥拉斯定理：", "$AC = \\sqrt{9^2 - 5.4^2} = \\sqrt{81 - 29.16} = \\sqrt{51.84} = 7.2$", "厘米。且 $\\cos\\widehat B = \\dfrac{AB}{BC} = \\dfrac{5.4}{9} = 0.6$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g8:cosine:11}", "边长为 $1$ 的等边三角形中，自一个顶点", "落在对边的\\emph{中点}上（该直线为", "对称轴）。三角形的一半是直角三角形，斜边为 $1$，", "（即一条完整的边），底边端点处的角为 $60^\\circ$，", "邻边为 $\\frac12$（底边的一半）。因此", "\\[", "\\cos 60^\\circ = \\frac{1/2}{1} = \\frac12 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g8:cosine:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 在三角形 $ABH$ 中，$H$ 为直角，", "由\\cref{thm:g7:triangles:sum}得", "$\\widehat B + 90^\\circ + \\widehat{BAH} = 180^\\circ$，于是", "$\\widehat{BAH} = 90^\\circ - \\widehat B$。在三角形 $ABC$ 中，", "$A$ 为直角：", "$\\widehat B + \\widehat C + 90^\\circ = 180^\\circ$，于是", "$\\widehat C = 90^\\circ - \\widehat B$。因此", "$\\widehat{BAH} = \\widehat{ACB}$：两个小三角形的", "角 $\\widehat B$、$\\widehat C$、$90^\\circ$ 与原三角形相同。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 在 $ABC$ 中（$A$ 为直角），与 $\\widehat B$ 相邻的边为", "$AB$，斜边为 $BC$：", "$\\cos\\widehat B = \\frac{AB}{BC}$。在 $ABH$ 中（$H$ 为直角），", "与 $\\widehat B$ 相邻的边为 $BH$，斜边为", "$AB$：$\\cos\\widehat B = \\frac{BH}{AB}$。该比值只依赖于", "角（见\\cref{def:g8:cosine:def}），于是", "\\[", "\\frac{AB}{BC} = \\frac{BH}{AB} ;", "\\]", "两边同乘 $BC \\times AB$（", "由\\cref{thm:g8:equations:balance}）：", "$AB^2 = BH \\times BC$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 三角形 $ABC$（$A$ 为直角）与 $ACH$", "（$H$ 为直角）有公共角 $\\widehat C$。两者中，邻边", "与斜边之比分别为：", "\\[", "\\cos\\widehat C = \\frac{AC}{CB} = \\frac{CH}{AC}", "\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\qquad", "AC^2 = CH \\times CB .", "\\]", ""]}